      "name": "specification-management",
      "title": "Specification and requirements management",
      "description": "Governs the lifecycle, syntax, and traceability of specifications and requirements across the harness. Connects spec-kit and CRDM tracks to the 6-part bootstrap Requirement definition, enforces EARS and ISO 29148 statement quality, and defines how requirements project to open standards (ReqIF, OSLC-RM) while keeping bootstrap strictly decoupled.",
